<!--
  Civilopedia: a Canals group in the base game's Game Concepts section, beside the three Canal building pages the
  Buildings section already generates. Chapter text resolves by key convention (base-standard model-civilopedia.js):
  LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_PAGE_<page>_CHAPTER_<chapter>_TITLE and ..._PARA_1, _PARA_2, ... until the first gap; the text is
  in text/en_us/CanalsText.xml. Layouts come first: pages and layout chapters have a foreign key onto them.
  The canal-site marker needs no exclude: the base game lists no removable features in the Civilopedia.
-->
